OL,3,GNEWSATour de France trophy arrives at
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tour de France Grand Depart Trophy
OL,7,Fhas gone on display in Sheffield ahead
OL,8,Fof the race coming to the region next
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe South Yorkshire city will be the
OL,12,Ffinish point of the second stage of the
OL,13,FTour de France Femmes event on 31 July.
OL,15,FThe women's Grand Depart will begin in
OL,16,FLeeds in the preceeding day before
OL,17,Fending in Manchester, with racers then
OL,18,Fheading across the Pennines to
OL,19,FSheffield on day two.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
